            <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-text-secondary mb-6">
                A Discord bot that does a bunch of stuff.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary mb-10">
                Free. Open source. Yours to use.
            </p>
            <a href="https://github.com/cpike5/discordbot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white bg-accent-orange hover:bg-accent-orange-hover active:bg-accent-orange-active rounded-lg transition-colors">
