                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Moderation</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Warnings, bans, moderator notes, watchlists and a review queue for flagged activity.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="feature-card bg-bg-secondary border border-border-primary rounded-lg p-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
